Build a complete **ultra-realistic, high-fidelity 3D environment** using Three.js / React Three Fiber.

**Model Quality Requirements:**
- Ultra-detailed low-level mesh geometry
- Smooth, organic surfaces (no generic boxy shapes)
- High polygon count with optimized topology
- Realistic proportions with subtle stylization
- Detailed surface textures (wood grain, stone weathering, metal reflections, cloth weave)
- Proper UV mapping and PBR materials
- Micro-details on every object (carvings, engravings, ornaments)
- Smooth subdivision surfaces
- Realistic material properties (metallic, roughness, subsurface scattering)
